    alias: gufranco
repository-code: https://github.com/gufranco/nec-upd7725-96050-python
url: https://github.com/gufranco/nec-upd7725-96050-python
abstract: >-
  A model of the NEC uPD7725 and uPD96050 digital signal processors. Every
  instruction form, addressing mode, flag, and pointer
  step is settled against states recorded from an independent reference rather
  than against its author's confidence, and nothing in it starts from a clean
  machine, because silicon powers up holding whatever it holds.
keywords:
  - emulation
  - digital-signal-processor
  - upd7725
  - upd96050
  - super-nintendo
  - hardware-model
  - conformance
